  "description": "Blazor support for AdCodicem value objects: InputValueObject, an input component that reads the text a person types into a form through the value object's rules, binds the normalized instance, shows the message of the rule that refuses it under the field and keeps the rule's code on the form's EditContext, with the messages in the application's language on request. AOT-compatible, and installable in a Blazor WebAssembly application.",
